Three small drifts from v1.14:
- the prose lists of mutating commands name `remove` but not `retire` (s329) or `handoff`: docs/commands.md around 195, docs/agents.md around 561, docs/how-it-works.md around 153 and 294, and the `_strict_flag` docstring in cli.py;
- the docs/commands.md troubleshooting row for a stale render does not mention s325's roadmap-only merge hint;
- the handoff refusal for a missing `handoff_requires_note_kind` note (ops.py, handoff) suggests `slicer note ... --kind ...` without `--render`, the same gap s351 closed in the relay text.
